            "pk": "18080484340716360",
            "text": "🔥 How to attract venture investments in sustainable technologies and scale up?\n\nOn July 29, Astana Hub will host a Fireside Chat with Tien Nguyen — an open conversation with an international investor working at the intersection of technology and sustainability.\n\nTien Nguyen is the founder of Earth VC, a Rockefeller Foundation AI and climate solutions expert in Asia, a Google for Startups mentor, and a participant in IFC (World Bank Group) investment initiatives.\n\nThis is not a lecture — just an open dialogue and a chance to ask your questions directly.\n\nYou will learn:\n • what trends are shaping climate tech and sustainable entrepreneurship today;\n • how venture funds make decisions in this niche;\n • and you will have the opportunity to network with ecosystem players and startup founders.\n\n📅 July 29, 16:00–18:00\n📍 Astana Hub, Block C 3.5, 1st floor, Hovard Lovecraft\n\n👉 Register in the Events section via the link in the profile.\n\n❓ What question would you ask an investor who funds technologies at the intersection of AI and sustainability?\nLeave a comment — we will pass the most interesting ones to the speaker during the Fireside Chat."
